[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14881.67, "timestamp": "04:08:01", "text": "Billy Billy 板子之类的东西。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14885.51, "timestamp": "04:08:05", "text": "就在那时，我意识到我正在做什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14887.83, "timestamp": "04:08:07", "text": "太多东西，也可能太多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14891.67, "timestamp": "04:08:11", "text": "是不是很震撼？我意识到我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14893.99, "timestamp": "04:08:13", "text": "需要分清轻重缓急，并削减一些项目。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14898.229, "timestamp": "04:08:18", "text": "不必要的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14900.71, "timestamp": "04:08:20", "text": "某种程度上，我有点儿……我有点儿……割舍"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14903.67, "timestamp": "04:08:23", "text": "做了很多事，但我仍然不明白。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14907.03, "timestamp": "04:08:27", "text": "用那个网站的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14910.55, "timestamp": "04:08:30", "text": "是的，我很怀念做那件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14913.189, "timestamp": "04:08:33", "text": "其实挺好玩的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14915.51, "timestamp": "04:08:35", "text": "听起来确实很有趣。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14917.189, "timestamp": "04:08:37", "text": "是的，你说的很有道理，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14919.189, "timestamp": "04:08:39", "text": "就像很容易被烧伤一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14921.75, "timestamp": "04:08:41", "text": "同时做很多事情。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14923.429, "timestamp": "04:08:43", "text": "是啊，也许最终你会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14926.469, "timestamp": "04:08:46", "text": "能够喜欢所有事情，并且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14928.63, "timestamp": "04:08:48", "text": "比如，“嗯，也许这就是人们所希望的。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14930.87, "timestamp": "04:08:50", "text": "想要。”就像也许人们真的用过一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14933.03, "timestamp": "04:08:53", "text": "很多时候都是这样。所以那时你就可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14935.03, "timestamp": "04:08:55", "text": "比如投入时间。但这很好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14937.269, "timestamp": "04:08:57", "text": "就像你在尝试新事物一样。嗯"}]